WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.788 --> 00:00:06.037
After hours. A used car lot, at night.

2
00:00:09.569 --> 00:00:13.269
This is a career, laid out like a game library.

3
00:00:15.356 --> 00:00:19.531
Who's playing? Hiring, running a dealership, or just looking.

4
00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:26.712
Pick the role you're hiring for. You keep the card, and a one-page resume written for that job.

5
00:00:30.306 --> 00:00:38.531
Six titles. Triple J Auto, Lead to Title, The Inbound, Prospector, Neuroscience, and Obavia, in development.

6
00:00:39.594 --> 00:00:48.594
In Lead to Title, run the sale desk. Scan the license once, and every form fills itself. Fictional buyer, example figures.

7
00:00:50.131 --> 00:00:53.981
18 trophies. Each one is a verified fact.

8
00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:01.237
Level 53. One level for each car sold personally since June 2025.

9
00:01:02.569 --> 00:01:05.169
Check me opens every proof link.

10
00:01:10.231 --> 00:01:11.656
Press start.

